{% doc %}
  A card-shaped skeleton shown while a product list is fetched (product
  recommendations section/block). Media box at the card's aspect ratio plus a
  title line and a price line, so the fetched card lands close to the same
  height — a bare ratio box is far shorter than a card with its text.

  @param {string} [image_ratio] - Card aspect ratio; blank → global card ratio, `auto` → 3/4
  @param {string} [mode] - `vertical` (default) or `horizontal`: thumbnail beside the two lines,

  the shape of a horizontal card (a `list` layout). The thumbnail reads the same `--media-width` / `--media-width-mobile` the real card does, so
  wherever the card's width is set, the skeleton follows.

  @example
  {% render 'product-card-placeholder', image_ratio: block.settings.pcard_image_ratio %}
  {% render 'product-card-placeholder', image_ratio: block.settings.pcard_image_ratio, mode: 'horizontal' %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign ratio = image_ratio
  if ratio == blank
    assign ratio = settings.pcard_aspect_ratio
  endif
  if ratio == blank or ratio == 'auto'
    assign ratio = '3/4'
  endif
-%}
{%- if mode == 'horizontal' -%}
  <div class="product-card-placeholder product-card-placeholder--horizontal" style="--ratio: {{ ratio }};" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="product-card-placeholder__media"></div>
    <div class="product-card-placeholder__text">
      <div class="product-card-placeholder__line"></div>
      <div class="product-card-placeholder__line product-card-placeholder__line--short"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- else -%}
  <div class="product-card-placeholder" style="--ratio: {{ ratio }};" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="product-card-placeholder__media"></div>
    <div class="product-card-placeholder__line"></div>
    <div class="product-card-placeholder__line product-card-placeholder__line--short"></div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
